:     * 【121†Authentication Options】\\nL233:     * 【122†Post-processing Options】\\nL234:     * 【123†SponsorBlock Options】\\nL235:     * 【124†Extractor Options】\\nL236:     * 【125†Preset Aliases】\\nL237:   * 【126†CONFIGURATION】\\nL238:     * 【127†Configuration file encoding】\\nL239:     * 【128†Authentication with netrc】\\nL240:     * 【129†Notes about environment variables】\\nL241:   * 【130†OUTPUT TEMPLATE】\\nL242:     * 【131†Output template examples】\\nL243:   * 【132†FORMAT SELECTION】\\nL244:     * 【133†Filtering Formats】\\nL245:     * 【134†Sorting Formats】\\nL246:     * 【135†Format Selection examples】\\nL247:   * 【136†MODIFYING METADATA】\\nL248:     * 【137†Modifying metadata examples】\\nL249:   * 【138†EXTRACTOR ARGUMENTS】\\nL250:   * 【139†PLUGINS】\\nL251:     * 【140†Installing Plugins】\\nL252:     * 【141†Developing Plugins】\\nL253:   * 【142†EMBEDDING YT-DLP】\\nL254:     * 【143†Embedding examples】\\nL255:   * 【144†CHANGES FROM YOUTUBE-DL】\\nL256:     * 【145†New features】\\nL257:     * 【146†Differences in default behavior】\\nL258:     * 【147†Deprecated options】\\nL259:   * 【148†CONTRIBUTING】\\nL260:     * 【149†Opening an Issue】\\nL261:     * 【150†Developer Instructions】\\nL262:   * 【52†WIKI】\\nL263:     * 【151†FAQ】\\nL264: # INSTALLATION\\nL265: \\nL266: You can install yt-dlp using 【104†the binaries】, 【152†pip†pypi.org】 or one using a third-party package manager. See 【103†the wiki】 for detailed instructions\\nL267: \\nL268: ## RELEASE FILES\\nL269: #### Recommended\\nL270: \\nL271: File  | Description\\nL272: --- | ---\\nL273: 【153†yt-dlp】  | Platform-independent 【154†zipimport†docs.python.org】 binary. Needs Python (recommended for Linux/BSD)\\nL274: 【155†yt-dlp.exe】  | Windows (Win10+) standalone x64 binary (recommended for Windows)\\nL275: 【156†yt-dlp_macos】  | Universal MacOS (10.15+) standalone executable (recommended for MacOS)\\nL276: #### Alternatives\\nL277: File  | Description\\nL278: --- | ---\\nL279: 【157†yt-dlp_linux】  | Linux (glibc 2.17+) standalone x86